========================================================================
READING
========================================================================
Detections that never associate into a stable track ID cannot open an
incident, however confident the detector was. Where a class is detected
often but holds no track, the ledger's recall is bounded by the TRACKER,
not by the detector - and a model improvement alone would not produce
more logged incidents on footage like this.

The lever that would: track the large, stable Person box and attach the
violation to it, rather than tracking the small violation box directly.
